# Keep the build context small. The image is built from source inside the Dockerfile, so local
# build output, dependencies, databases and editor or agent state stay out.
.git
.claude
.mochiprep
**/node_modules
target
**/dist
docs
packaging
e2e
# Recursive: a database anywhere in the tree can hold unencrypted AI keys.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
